Package: pulzr-concentrator
Provides: parkeze-concentrator
Replaces: parkeze-concentrator
Conflicts: parkeze-concentrator
Depends: pulzr-base, ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, jsonfilter, jshn, ca-bundle, coreutils-stty
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0 AND MIT
Architecture: all
Description: LoRaWAN concentrator detection and packet forwarder supervision.
 Probes SPI, USB and UART for a Semtech SX130x concentrator, writes the
 detected hardware into UCI, and renders the packet forwarder configuration
 for the detected part and the configured region.
